        "hypothesis": "Pairing bands along the smaller matrix dimension reduces the work from O(M·N²) to O(min(M,N)²·max(M,N)); storing the oriented matrix contiguously also makes each band extension scan contiguous data.",
        "id": "ff5ae3a428fe4053",
        "ordinal": 1,
        "parent_id": null,
