            "Factor the per-band prefix-sum frequency count into a shared routine, then dynamically schedule outer column-band groups across up to four OpenMP workers with a private map per worker and a 64-bit sum reduction.",
            "Keep small estimated workloads serial to limit parallel overhead."
          ]
        },
