            "Keep the measured smaller-dimension band orientation, incremental contiguous compressed sums, and 4096-slot generation-stamped table with signed 64-bit prefixes and answer accumulation.",
            "Factor the per-pair band count and dynamically schedule independent band-start groups across up to four workers, with a private frequency table per worker and a 64-bit reduction.",
